# Keep the Docker build context lean — only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.md
*.log
*.bak
.env
.env.*
docker-compose*.yml
saas_multi_tenant
pkg/db/gen
# config.go is hand-written (db connection helper) and lives alongside the
# sqlc-generated output. Keep it in the build context so the Go build can
# resolve `db.Connect`.
!pkg/db/gen/config.go
**/*.pdf
ifritah
ifritah.exe
web-service-gin
